scenarios = Array[String](["Acidic water is rising toward your waist in a flooded tunnel! You must open the rusted iron grate blocking your escape without getting burned by the acid. Nearby items: a heavy steel crowbar, thick rubber gauntlets, and a fragile glass lantern.", "A medkit you desperately need is pinned beneath the tail of a sleeping cave stalker! Retrieve the medkit without waking or getting mauled by the beast. Nearby items: a slab of raw venison, five meters of hooked rope, and a hunting knife.", "A ruptured boiler pipe is blasting scalding steam directly across the only shutoff valve! Turn the valve before the boiler explodes without getting scalded. Nearby items: insulated leather gloves, a long-handled wrench, and a wooden crate lid.", "A suspicious city guard stops you at the gate and demands to search your satchel, which hides stolen royal ciphers! Get past the checkpoint without being arrested or exposing the ciphers. Nearby items: twenty silver coins, a signed courier seal, and a smoke pellet.", "Two armored patrol automatons have cornered you in a narrow alley beneath a suspended cargo net of scrap iron! Disable or escape the automatons without getting crushed or shot. Nearby items: the net's release lever, an oil canister, and a flare gun.", "Flames are creeping across an oil-soaked rug toward a locked wooden archive chest! Save the chest's contents before it burns without catching fire yourself. Nearby items: a soaked wool blanket, a bucket of sand, and an iron pry bar.", "Your heavy supply sled is stuck halfway across a groaning, cracked sheet of river ice! Recover the sled to solid ground before the ice gives way beneath you. Nearby items: a shore-anchored winch cable, two wide wooden planks, and a heavy pickaxe.", "You must trigger the exit lever at the far end of a pressure-tiled corridor lined with poison dart slits! Pull the lever without getting hit by the darts. Nearby items: a ten-foot wooden pole, a heavy tower shield, and a pouch of steel marbles.", "A severed high-voltage cable is sparking in a puddle directly in front of the airlock keypad! Unlock the keypad to escape without getting electrocuted. Nearby items: a fiberglass hook pole, rubber-soled boots, and a roll of electrical tape.", "The jailer's key ring hangs on a peg just inside a kennel guarded by a snarling warhound on a short chain! Grab the keys without getting bitten or alerting the guardhouse. Nearby items: a drugged meat pie, a long broom handle, and a thick leather cloak."])

